# NOTE: pycryptodome was removed. Nothing under app/ ever imported it — no `from Crypto`
# anywhere in the service. It is a compiled C extension, so carrying it meant a build
# dependency and a CVE surface for code that never ran. Karto's only crypto is JWT
# verification, which pyjwt[crypto] handles via cryptography. Do not add it back.